    {
      "id": "e14",
      "name": "Table 13",
      "hidden": false,
      "parentId": null,
      "inheritedFrom": null,
      "kind": "table",
      "text": "TACTIC\nDESCRIPTION\nIMPACT\nPreferred Package for Youth & Students\nOffer $0 commissions to Retail Preferred Package account holders <=23, expanding to <=25 in Q1/26\nTargeting 10% lift in youth and student acquisition to deliver $175M Contribution Margin (CM) annually\nWinter Campaign\nOffer 1% cashback for other FI assets and lower tiered base for BNS assets\nTarget Highly Active and Active Traders\nIncr. AUA, acquire new clients, and win back inactive clients\nProjected AUA of $1.7 Bn (55% OFI assets)\n5M net new clients, and $5.4MM in CM\nEstimated incentive cost $9MM\nExpand Sales & Enablement Team\nRebuild scorecard to focus on new client acquisition\nChange mandate from inbound only to inbound & outbound supported by new Retail leads\nAcquire 17M new active clients (+49% Y/Y)\nRetention Offer:  Inbound NSA\nOffer custom discounts based on client profitability\nActive options traders contribute $25MM in annual CM\nWorst case attrition risk estimated to be $9MM CM loss\nEvery incremental 1% retained results in $250M saved CM\nRetention Offer: Outbound Test & Learn\nOffer preferred option pricing with A/B test tied to RSP campaign\n\nPreferred Pricing BNS Employees\nOffer $0 commissions on stocks, ETFs and base options to all BNS employees\nTarget 36M staff, forecasted to deliver 900 new clients & $942M CM in F26\nLadder to Wealth Campaign\nTarget iClub Platinum clients with benefits of becoming Wealth clients (e.g., email campaigns)\nTarget 16M iTRADE Clients with >$1MM in assets\nDrive awareness of CWM offerings and incr. referral opps.\nHigh Value Client Engagement\nRevitalize high-value client program (e.g., provide them access to digital tools)\nTop 3 high-value segments form 23% of clients, who contribute 80% of AUA and 70% of CM\nIncrease engagement and loyalty of this segment to reduce attrition risk and sustain asset growth and trading activity",
      "placeholder": null,
      "typography": null,
      "sourcePart": "ppt/slides/slide58.xml",
